---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
const steps=[['Understand the business','I start by listening: how the team works, what leaders need to see, and where the operational friction shows up. The goal is a shared understanding of what matters most.'],['Agree on priorities','Together, we identify the work that deserves attention and define what progress should look like. The scope and working rhythm should fit your business.'],['Work alongside the team','I participate in leadership conversations, help coordinate across functions, and take responsibility for moving agreed priorities forward.'],['Build a useful rhythm','We review progress, make decisions with better information, and adjust as the business changes. The focus stays on practical improvements the team can sustain.']];
---
<Layout title="How I Work" description="Embedded, part-time Revenue Operations leadership. A practical, ongoing partnership with Wade Olcott, designed around your business."><section class="wrap page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">How I work</p><h1>Inside the team.<br/>Close to the work.</h1><p class="text-xl">Experienced leadership, without another full-time executive role.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-24"><div><h2>A working partnership.</h2><p>I work with one or two companies at a time as an embedded, part-time member of their leadership teams. This is an ongoing relationship, with room to understand the business and contribute consistently.</p><p>The right engagement depends on what you need. We agree on priorities, responsibilities, and a working rhythm together.</p><p class="quote mt-10">I'm there to help do the work, not just tell you what needs to be done.</p></div><div>{steps.map(([title,body],i)=><article class="border-t border-[#cbd4d8] py-7"><p class="eyebrow mb-3">0{i+1}</p><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><ContactCTA/></Layout>
